{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いてくださりありがとうございます‼︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の森平麗心です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5月生まれの方、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お誕生日おめでとうございます！🎉"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な一年になりますように！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒に幸せな5月にしましょうね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41stもよろしくお願いします！💚🤍"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobX2bGBX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "制服かわいくて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人っぽくてお気に入りです🪻🤍"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob2A5P0c.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「エルフみたい！」とか、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "耳出てるの好きって言ってくださる方が多くて嬉しいです🧝🏻‍♀️🏹🍃"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大きな耳がコンプレックスだったんですけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんのおかげで少しずつ好きになれました！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobecJukP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして41stシングル「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」発売記念 ミニライブ　配信で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「桜橋を教えてくれた」を披露しました‼︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "桜をイメージした振り付けが沢山あって、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に大好きです🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何回聴いても素敵な曲なので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVもぜひ沢山観てください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/TNHVgK7HLfY"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobsHKggp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいいここねんショット📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今更なのですが…"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#ハッシュタグ を考えてみました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#うるぶろぐ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木メ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#うるめ〜る"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "トーク"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#うると〜く"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イラスト"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#うる美"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ファンの方"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うる民"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "マーク"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐱🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "考えていたら色々思いついて…☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「#うる美」は、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミーグリでイラストを見せていただくことが多いので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひハッシュタグをつけて投稿してくださったら嬉しいな〜と思って考えました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あと、自分を表すマークみたいなのも欲しくて…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "猫顔と向日葵が好きなので"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🐱🌻 にしてみました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ沢山使ってください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここまで読んでくださってありがとうございます〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もりひらうるみ🐱🌻"}], "source": "official"}